iveTouch:`Drag to steer and drive, hold the red <b>Brake</b> pedal to stop. Follow the arrow to a <b class="c">turquoise ring</b> and drive through it to pick up a package.`,tourDeliverKeys:`Now take it to the <b class="y">yellow ring</b> before the clock at the top runs out. Time left over pays a bonus. <kbd>G</kbd> draws the way on the road.`,tourDeliverTouch:`Now take it to the <b class="y">yellow ring</b> before the clock at the top runs out. Time left over pays a bonus. Tap the little map for a big one.`,tourPolice:e=>`${b_(S_(e))} make a run for the scoreboard, and a run can be sent to a friend to beat. Mind the police: knocking people over or ramming brings patrol cars.`,tourNoDeliveries:`No deliveries around here: too few streets. Try another place from the menu.`,tourStep:(e,t)=>`${e} of ${t}`,tourOnFootTouch:`You are on foot. Walk up to a car and tap <b>Get in</b>. A parked one is free to take.`,tourOnFootKeys:`You are on foot. Walk up to a car and press <kbd>E</kbd>. A parked one is free to take.`,searchNone:`Nothing found by that name. Check the spelling, or add the country.`,searchSilent:`The place search isn’t answering right now. Try a city button, a big city by name, or type lat, lon.`,noName:`No name`,runComplete:`Run complete`,runSent:`The run you were sent`,runBeat:e=>`You beat ${e||`the run you were sent`}`,runBehind:e=>`${e} stays ahead`,runLine:(e,t,n)=>`${b_(S_(e))} in ${t} · ${n}`,runRival:(e,t,n)=>`${e}: ${t} in ${n}`,runSendBack:e=>`Send your run back to ${e||`them`}`,runNote:e=>`Makes a link to send: the same ${S_(e)}, with your score to beat.`,continueJobs:`Continue with open jobs`,runShare:(e,t,n,r)=>`Beat my run in ${e}: ${t} in ${n}, ${S_(r)}.`,runTheirs:e=>`Whoever opens it plays your ${S_(e)}.`,newRunToast:e=>`New run: ${S_(e)}`,hudRun:(e,t,n)=>`Run ${e}/${t} · ${n}`,hudToBeat:e=>`to beat ${e}`,getOut:`Get out`,actGetIn:`Get in`,guessCity:`Guess the city`,guessTap:`tap when you know`,playIn:e=>`Play in ${e}`,whereIAm:`Where I am`,fin